 "archived": {
  "reanimator": "S66 (Part 2, ADR-167's probe; Chris): the Ossuary archived. 24.7% against Esper's field (360 games). Its reanimation aims right (489 of 506 casts raised a piece) but the pieces land late — 9% by turn six, 40% never — and half the losses had a piece answered (Swords 27, Control Magic 22, Vindicate 12, Doom Blade 8, Wrath 6; Edicts 2). For the planner: a timing rule would lift it only into the second failure — Esper's removal meets the pieces. Last measured 17.6 in matches (S65's table)."
